<section class="setup-page section-shell"><p class="eyebrow">One-time local setup</p><h1>Finish connecting Leon’s Code.</h1><p>The website shell is ready, but it needs its MySQL connection before course and account data can load.</p><ol><li>Copy <code>.env.example</code> to <code>.env</code> and set a local database name and credentials.</li><li>Create that MySQL database with UTF-8 support.</li><li>Run <code>php bin/migrate.php</code>, then <code>php bin/seed.php</code>.</li><li>Run <code>php bin/create-admin.php "Your name" you@example.com</code> to create the first administrator.</li></ol><a class="button" href="index.html">Open the available Java Lab</a></section>
